---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import aboutHero from '../assets/about_hero.webp';
---

	<Layout title="About Us | VO2 Bikes – Verified Pre-owned Bikes" description="Learn how VO2 Bikes selects and verifies pre-owned cycling bikes.">
		<section class="about-hero hero-band" style={`--hero-bg: #090d10 url(${aboutHero.src}) 70% center / cover no-repeat`}>
			<div class="about-inner">
				<p class="eyebrow">Better bikes. Better backed.</p>
				<h1 class="display-heading">Real <span>bikes. </span> <br> Real <span>TRUST. </span></h1>
				<p class="lead">Beyond Bikes. <br> Beyond Boundaries.</p>
			</div>
		</section>
		<section class="about-content">
			<div class="about-inner">
				<p class="eyebrow">Built by Riders. Driven by Trust.</p>
				<div class="about-copy">
					<p>At VO<sub>2</sub> Bikes, cycling is more than a hobby. It's a pursuit of progress, performance and new possibilities.</p>
					<p>As cyclists and aspiring triathletes ourselves, we understand the journey — from the first ride to the training sessions, challenging climbs and finish lines that make every effort worthwhile. We also know that finding the right bike matters. But when buying pre-owned, knowing exactly what you're getting can be just as important as finding the right price.</p>
					<p>That's why we started VO<sub>2</sub> Bikes.</p>
					<p>Our mission is to make buying and selling pre-owned bicycles a more transparent, dependable and rider-focused experience. We carefully select quality bikes and evaluate each one against the same detailed inspection standard. Every listing includes an inspection score, category-wise results and bike-specific notes, giving you a clearer picture of the bike's condition and helping you compare options with confidence.</p>
					<p>Here's what we're building differently:</p>
					<ul class="about-points">
						<li>
							<span class="eyebrow">🔍Inspection before listing</span>
							<span class="about-point-detail">We follow a structured process to assess the frame, fork, wheels, brakes, drivetrain and key components.</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="eyebrow">📋Transparency that matters</span>
							<span class="about-point-detail">We document known defects, condition and work carried out, rather than leaving you to discover surprises later.</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="eyebrow">⚙️Value, not just a low price</span>
							<span class="about-point-detail">We help you explore bikes with the specifications and performance you want, at a price that makes sense for you.</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="eyebrow">🤝Cyclist-first thinking</span>
							<span class="about-point-detail">We're building this brand around the things riders care about: the bike, the details and the ride ahead.</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
					<p>Whether you're buying your first road bike, looking for your next upgrade, or preparing for your next big challenge, we're here to help you choose a ride that fits your ambitions.</p>
					<p>We're riders building something for riders — with trust at the heart of every ride.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
		<section class="delivery-section" aria-labelledby="delivery-title">
			<div class="delivery-inner">
				<div class="delivery-intro">
					<p class="eyebrow">Our location</p>
					<h2 id="delivery-title">FROM <span>PUNE</span>.<br />ACROSS <span>INDIA</span>.</h2>
					<p>VO<sub>2</sub> Bikes operates from Pune, Maharashtra, serving cycling enthusiasts locally and beyond.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="delivery-content">
					<article class="delivery-card">
						<h3>Beyond Pune – We Deliver</h3>
						<p>Not based in Pune? No problem. We arrange bike deliveries across India.</p>
						<p>Every bike is carefully prepared, packed and secured before dispatch to minimise the risk of transit damage.</p>
					</article>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="delivery-terms-line">
				<p class="delivery-terms"><strong>Delivery Terms:</strong> Shipping charges are borne by the customer, and transit risk is the customer's responsibility. Delivery arrangements and charges are confirmed before dispatch.</p>
			</div>
		</section>
	</Layout>

<style>
	.about-hero { padding: 5rem clamp(1.25rem, 10vw, 10rem) 3rem; background: var(--hero-bg);}
	/* width:100% keeps the inner full-width (and left-aligned) now that .about-hero
	   is a flex container — auto cross margins would otherwise shrink-wrap and centre it. */
	.about-inner { width: 100%; max-width: 100vw; margin: 0 auto;}
	.about-content { padding: 4.5rem clamp(1.25rem, 7vw, 7rem) 1.5rem; background: #080c0f; }
	.about-hero .display-heading { margin: 0.35rem 0 0; }
	.about-hero .display-heading span { color: var(--signal); }
	.about-hero .lead { margin-top: 0.35rem; }
	.about-copy p, ul { color: #cfdddf; font-size: 0.83rem; line-height: 1.85; }
	.about-copy .about-points { display: grid; gap: 1.5rem; margin: 1.5rem 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
	.about-copy .about-points .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
	.about-copy .about-point-detail { display: block; }
	.about-copy p.about-signoff { margin: 1.6rem 0 0; color: var(--paper); font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: 0.02em; text-transform: uppercase; }
	.about-copy .about-signoff span { color: var(--signal); }
	.delivery-section { padding: 1.5rem clamp(1.25rem, 7vw, 7rem) 5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); background: rgba(9, 14, 17, 0.96); }
	.delivery-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem); align-items: start; max-width: 1440px; margin: 0 auto; }
	.delivery-intro h2 { margin: 0.6rem 0 0; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.9vw, 4rem); line-height: 0.95; text-transform: uppercase; }
	.delivery-intro h2 span { color: var(--signal); }
	.delivery-intro > p:last-child { max-width: 520px; margin: 1.4rem 0 0; color: #cfdddf; font-size: 0.83rem; line-height: 1.85; }
	.delivery-content { display: grid; gap: 1.25rem; }
	.delivery-card { padding: 1.75rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: rgba(8, 12, 15, 0.9); }
	.delivery-card h3 { margin: 0 0 1rem; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.4vw, 2.8rem); line-height: 1; text-transform: uppercase; }
	.delivery-card p { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: #d4e0e2; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.75; }
	.delivery-card p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
	.delivery-card strong { color: var(--paper); }
	.delivery-terms-line { max-width: 1440px; margin: 1.5rem auto 0; }
	.delivery-terms { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.7; }
	.delivery-terms strong { color: var(--paper); }
	@media (max-width: 760px) { .about-hero { padding: 3.5rem 1.4rem 2.5rem; background-position: 82% center; } .about-content { padding-top: 3rem; padding-bottom: 1rem; } .delivery-section { padding: 1rem 1.4rem 3rem; } .delivery-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
